---
---

<section id="security" class="py-20 relative overflow-hidden">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="p-8 sm:p-12 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-oled-900 to-oled-950 border border-brand-500/30 glow-brand relative">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
        
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 text-xs font-mono font-bold mb-4">
            <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-brand-400"></span>
            Compromiso Absoluto de Privacidad
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
            Tus claves privadas nunca abandonan tu dispositivo
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-4 text-gray-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
            A diferencia de herramientas web o servicios en la nube que procesan tus claves en servidores remotos, <strong>Signet opera con el principio de aislamiento total</strong>. No disponemos de servidores de almacenamiento, no integramos SDKs de analítica de terceros y no rastreamos ninguna actividad.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-6 space-y-3">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-300"><strong>Cero recolección de datos:</strong> No recopilamos contraseñas, alias, huellas ni identificadores de hardware.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-300"><strong>Arquitectura 100% Offline:</strong> La generación de certificados se ejecuta íntegramente en la CPU del teléfono.</span>
            </div>

            <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
              <div class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-500/20 text-brand-400 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                <svg class="w-3.5 h-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="3" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              </div>
              <span class="text-sm text-gray-300"><strong>Transparencia Open Source:</strong> Todo el código fuente está disponible y auditado bajo licencia GPL v3.</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-8">
            <a
              href="/privacy"
              class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-300 transition-colors"
            >
              Leer Política de Privacidad Completa
              <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-5 bg-oled-950 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-800 font-mono text-xs text-gray-300">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-gray-800 text-gray-400">
            <span class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-500/80"></span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-yellow-500/80"></span>
              <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-green-500/80"></span>
              signet-security-audit.json
            </span>
            <span class="text-[10px] text-brand-400">VERIFIED</span>
          </div>
          <pre class="mt-4 overflow-x-auto text-gray-300 leading-relaxed">
<code>&#123;
  <span class="text-brand-400">"network_telemetry"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-400">false</span>,
  <span class="text-brand-400">"analytics_trackers"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-400">0</span>,
  <span class="text-brand-400">"cloud_upload_keys"</span>: <span class="text-emerald-400">false</span>,
  <span class="text-brand-400">"storage_location"</span>: <span class="text-yellow-300">"Local SQLite (Room)"</span>,
  <span class="text-brand-400">"anti_tamper_seal"</span>: <span class="text-yellow-300">"HMAC-SHA256"</span>,
  <span class="text-brand-400">"license"</span>: <span class="text-yellow-300">"GNU GPL v3.0"</span>
&#125;</code>
          </pre>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
